          "ruleId": "review-note",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "ms2xqi8u9pzl5drk",
          "message": {
            "text": "Each warner's gate is now its own env var and nothing else — the isDevMode() call that used to sit above this line is gone along with src/utils/devMode.ts.\n\nReaching this function at all means the consumer imported kerfjs/dev, which IS the development signal. Re-asking NODEENV was redundant in the browser (where the read is undefined and the answer is always \"dev\") and actively wrong in Node: a consumer who deliberately installed the diagnostics under NODEENV=production got silence from an opt-in they had explicitly requested.\n\nThe same deletion applies to all twelve dev-* modules; this note stands for the set.\n",
            "markdown": "Each warner's gate is now its own env var and nothing else — the `isDevMode()` call that used to sit above this line is gone along with `src/utils/devMode.ts`.\n\nReaching this function at all means the consumer imported `kerfjs/dev`, which IS the development signal. Re-asking `NODE_ENV` was redundant in the browser (where the read is `undefined` and the answer is always \"dev\") and actively wrong in Node: a consumer who deliberately installed the diagnostics under `NODE_ENV=production` got silence from an opt-in they had explicitly requested.\n\nThe same deletion applies to all twelve `dev-*` modules; this note stands for the set.\n"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/dev-store-warn.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 49,
                  "endLine": 52,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  + 'Set KERF_DEV_WARN_NARROW_SET=0 (or unset it) to silence this warning.';\n\nexport function isOptedIn(): boolean {\n  const proc = (globalThis as { process?: { env?: Record<string, string | undefined> } }).process;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ]
          },
